{"seq":1,"slug":"dropship-fulfillment-models-taxonomy","title":"代发履约模式与商业模型分类（纯代发/一件代发/仓配代发/白标）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/dropship-model-supplier-network/dropship-fulfillment-models-taxonomy","wordCount":3083,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"代发履约模式与商业模型分类-纯代发-一件代发-仓配代发-白标\">代发履约模式与商业模型分类（纯代发/一件代发/仓配代发/白标）</h1><p>同一个「代发」标签下，实际藏着履约链路、成本结构与合规风险都截然不同的四种模式。把一家媒体型选品站和一家自有品牌站都叫「dropshipping」，就像把摆地摊和开连锁店都叫「零售」——工程上要处理的库存一致性、尾程时效、退货归属问题完全不是一回事。本文先把这四种模式拆成可对齐工程接口的类型，再讨论它们各自的经济模型与合规约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代发履约（dropship fulfillment）的本质是：<strong>销售方不持有可售库存，订单确认后把履约动作委托给上游供应商或代发服务商</strong>。商品从供应商的仓或工厂直接发往终端买家，销售方在物理链路上从来不接触货物。这一「轻资产」特征带来三个必须显式建模的工程后果：库存是租来的（存在超卖与断货的同步延迟）、尾程是外包的（时效与丢件责任在供应商与物流商之间，需契约化 SLA）、退货地址与处置权决定了售后成本由谁承担。</p>\n<p>按「谁持有库存 / 是否暴露供应商身份 / 尾程由谁负责」三个维度，可以把市面上的做法归到四种模式。下表给出它们最关键的工程差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>纯代发（Pure Marketplace）</th>\n<th>一件代发（Classic Dropship）</th>\n<th>仓配代发（Stocked / Prepaid）</th>\n<th>白标 / 私有品牌（White Label）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存归属</td>\n<td>平台托管，卖家只选品</td>\n<td>供应商持有，卖家零库存</td>\n<td>卖家预付、货入服务商仓</td>\n<td>卖家下单生产，品牌归卖家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打包内容</td>\n<td>平台标准包装</td>\n<td>供应商中性包装（可盲发）</td>\n<td>服务商仓按卖家要求打包</td>\n<td>定制包装/插卡，隐去供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商身份</td>\n<td>平台前端不暴露</td>\n<td>面单不得出现供应商信息（盲发）</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>完全隐藏，露出自有品牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾程时效可控性</td>\n<td>低（跟随平台）</td>\n<td>中（跟随供应商）</td>\n<td>高（卖家可指定渠道）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型单位毛利</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>最高（含品牌溢价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>平台政策与同质竞争</td>\n<td>库存同步与时效不可控</td>\n<td>备货资金占用与滞销</td>\n<td>起订量（MOQ）与合规责任</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四种模式的订单履约链路可用一张图概括它们「货物从哪来、面单怎么写、退货回哪去」的分叉：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[买家下单] --&gt; R{卖家路由决策}&#10;  R --&gt;|纯代发| P[平台内部履约&lt;br/&gt;供应商身份不暴露]&#10;  R --&gt;|一件代发| S[供应商直发&lt;br/&gt;中性面单盲发]&#10;  R --&gt;|仓配代发| W[代发仓拣货打包&lt;br/&gt;卖家指定尾程]&#10;  R --&gt;|白标| B[品牌方下单生产&lt;br/&gt;定制包装后发货]&#10;  P --&gt; T[尾程承运商]&#10;  S --&gt; T&#10;  W --&gt; T&#10;  B --&gt; T&#10;  T --&gt; C[终端买家签收]&#10;  C --&gt;|退货| RET{退货归属}&#10;  RET --&gt;|退回代发仓| W&#10;  RET --&gt;|退回第三方退货地址| S&#10;  RET --&gt;|退款不退货| P\">graph TD\n  O[买家下单] --&gt; R{卖家路由决策}\n  R --&gt;|纯代发| P[平台内部履约&lt;br/&gt;供应商身份不暴露]\n  R --&gt;|一件代发| S[供应商直发&lt;br/&gt;中性面单盲发]\n  R --&gt;|仓配代发| W[代发仓拣货打包&lt;br/&gt;卖家指定尾程]\n  R --&gt;|白标| B[品牌方下单生产&lt;br/&gt;定制包装后发货]\n  P --&gt; T[尾程承运商]\n  S --&gt; T\n  W --&gt; T\n  B --&gt; T\n  T --&gt; C[终端买家签收]\n  C --&gt;|退货| RET{退货归属}\n  RET --&gt;|退回代发仓| W\n  RET --&gt;|退回第三方退货地址| S\n  RET --&gt;|退款不退货| P</pre><h3 id=\"一分钟建立经济模型直觉\">一分钟建立经济模型直觉</h3><p>无论哪种模式，单件边际贡献都可写成同一形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Contribution</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>shipping</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>payment</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>returns</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>platform</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Contribution} = P - C_{\\text{goods}} - C_{\\text{shipping}} - C_{\\text{payment}} - C_{\\text{returns}} - C_{\\text{platform}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contribution</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shipping</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payment</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">returns</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是售价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是拿货价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>shipping</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{shipping}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shipping</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是含头程分摊与尾程的物流成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>payment</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{payment}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payment</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是支付手续费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>returns</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{returns}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">returns</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是退货损耗，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>platform</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{platform}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平台佣金或广告分摊。四种模式的差别不在公式，而在<strong>每一项的量级与方差</strong>：白标压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>；一件代发把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>shipping</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{shipping}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shipping</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的方差推高；仓配代发把资金占用前置，用确定性换取时效确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纯代发与一件代发的工程差异\">纯代发与一件代发的工程差异</h2><p>「纯代发」指卖家在一个托管平台上选品、平台内部完成履约——卖家的角色更接近流量分发者。平台把货源、仓储、尾程、售后收进一个闭环，卖家只负责上架和投放；对包装、时效、供应商选择几乎没有控制权，好处是接入成本低、无需自建 ERP。</p>\n<p>「一件代发」则是卖家自建店面，把订单通过 API 或插件推给独立供应商。CJ Dropshipping 官网（2026 年）自述其网络覆盖 10+ 全球发货仓、1M+ 合作制造商、120+ 全球物流合作方，并提供「实时库存同步」与「多通道订单自动化」，已对接 Shopify、WooCommerce、TikTok Shop、Temu、Shopee、eBay、Etsy 等渠道（来源：CJ Dropshipping 官网 <a href=\"https://cjdropshipping.com/）。这代表了一件代发工程的核心：**一个卖家连接多个供应商，多个渠道连接同一个供应商网络**，形成\">https://cjdropshipping.com/）。这代表了一件代发工程的核心：**一个卖家连接多个供应商，多个渠道连接同一个供应商网络**，形成</a> N×M 的同步矩阵。</p>\n<p>两者的分水岭是<strong>面单与身份的可见性</strong>。一件代发的行业默认是「盲发」（blind shipping）——面单、装箱单、包装内不得出现供应商的名称、Logo 或价格。盲发不是审美偏好，而是防止买家绕过卖家直接向供应商下单，是代发商业模式的护城河。工程上它要求：面单寄件人字段由卖家配置、包裹内不得夹带供应商营销物料、供应商后台模板支持「匿名化」。</p>\n<p>两者共同的技术债是<strong>库存同步延迟</strong>。卖家前端显示的可售量是缓存值，真实可用量在供应商侧；从「供应商扣减库存」到「卖家前端刷新」之间的时间窗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 就是超卖窗口。经验做法是把可售量按安全系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in (0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 缩水展示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>displayed</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>supplier_available</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{displayed} = \\lfloor \\alpha \\cdot \\text{supplier\\_available} \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">displayed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supplier_available</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>并在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 上做限流——同步频率越高，超卖越少，但 API 配额消耗越大，这是必须在设计期定下的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓配代发-用资金换时效确定性\">仓配代发：用资金换时效确定性</h2><p>仓配代发（也叫预存代发 / prepaid dropship）的做法是：卖家不压货在自有仓，但把一批货<strong>预付</strong>给代发服务商，货物入服务商的海外仓或区域仓，此后订单由服务商从仓内拣货打包发出。它和一件代发的关键区别是<strong>库存的所有权与位置</strong>——货已在物流半径内，尾程可做到 2-5 日达，而非跟随供应商工厂的发货节奏。</p>\n<p>这一模式的工程价值在于把「不可控」换成「可控」：卖家可指定尾程承运商、把多供应商商品合并到一个仓合单发货、自行决定包装。代价是三重：<strong>资金占用</strong>（预付货值在售出前是死库存，周转率下降）、<strong>滞销风险</strong>（卖不动的货要么折价清仓要么承担长期仓储费）、<strong>补货协调</strong>（需预测销量决定补货点）。</p>\n<p>一个可用的补货触发规则是安全库存法：当仓内可用量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 低于再订货点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 时补货，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\bar{d}L + z\\sigma_{dL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9145em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是提前期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是日均需求，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{dL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提前期内需求标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 由目标服务水平查正态分位数得到。</p>\n<p>仓配代发也常与「区域仓」组合：同一 SKU 在美东、美西各备一批，路由层按买家邮编就近发货，把尾程成本与时效同时优化。这已进入订单路由问题，属于本 hub 后续章节的范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"白标与私有品牌-把代发链路品牌化\">白标与私有品牌：把代发链路品牌化</h2><p>白标（white label）与私有品牌（private label）是代发的品牌化终点：产品由工厂或代发商按卖家规格生产，包装、说明书、保修卡、品牌露出全部归卖家。白标通常指「现成的通用产品贴上你的品牌」，私有品牌则进一步要求配方、模具或规格定制——两者的共同点是<strong>买家在整个链路上永远看不到供应商</strong>。</p>\n<p>工程上，白标把代发从「转发订单」升级为「管理一个隐形的供应链」，需要处理定制物料的主数据（品牌包装、感谢卡、贴纸都是独立 BOM 项，需随订单路由到打包环节）、MOQ 约束（库存决策从「按单补货」变成「按批次压货」，资金曲线更陡）、以及合规责任转移：产品打上你的品牌后，产品安全、标签、认证的法定责任落到卖家而非匿名供应商。以欧盟为例，把自有品牌产品投放市场即成为法规意义上的「生产者」，需承担产品责任与标签义务；这条边界在匿名代发时由供应商承担，白标后由卖家承担。</p>\n<h3 id=\"盲发链路的三种模式对照\">盲发链路的三种模式对照</h3><p>盲发（不暴露供应商）在三种模式下实现难度递增，这直接决定技术投入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>盲发实现方式</th>\n<th>主要泄露风险点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一件代发</td>\n<td>供应商侧配置匿名面单模板</td>\n<td>装箱单夹带供应商 Logo、包裹内营销卡片、退货地址露底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓配代发</td>\n<td>代发仓按卖家模板打包</td>\n<td>入库标签残留、不同卖家共仓时的错发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白标</td>\n<td>定制包装 + 定制物料一并入仓</td>\n<td>定制物料忘配、批次混装导致品牌不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式选择的合规与政策约束\">模式选择的合规与政策约束</h2><p>模式选择不只是成本题，2025-2026 年的政策环境已经把它变成合规题。三条约束在跨境代发里最常触发：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，低值进口免税通道的关闭。</strong> 美国长期依赖 Section 321 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn><mtext>美元</mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>免税额度，让低价跨境小包免关税入境。</mtext><mn>2025</mn><mtext>年美国先对中国大陆与香港包裹取消该豁免，随后签署行政令把暂停扩大到全球，自</mtext><mn>2025</mn><mtext>年</mtext><mn>8</mn><mtext>月</mtext><mn>29</mn><mtext>日起生效，并对邮政渠道给出按件固定税或按价从价税的过渡选项（来源：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>；</mtext><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>）。直接后果是「中国直发小包</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>免税」的低成本模型被打破，关税与尾程须重新计入</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800 美元 de minimis 免税额度，让低价跨境小包免关税入境。2025 年美国先对中国大陆与香港包裹取消该豁免，随后签署行政令把暂停扩大到全球，自 2025 年 8 月 29 日起生效，并对邮政渠道给出按件固定税或按价从价税的过渡选项（来源：CBP https://www.cbp.gov/trade/basic-import-export/de-minimis；Federal Register https://www.federalregister.gov/）。直接后果是「中国直发小包 + 免税」的低成本模型被打破，关税与尾程须重新计入</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">美元</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">minimi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免税额度，让低价跨境小包免关税入境。</span><span class=\"mord\">2025</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年美国先对中国大陆与香港包裹取消该豁免，随后签署行政令把暂停扩大到全球，自</span><span class=\"mord\">2025</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月</span><span class=\"mord\">29</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日起生效，并对邮政渠道给出按件固定税或按价从价税的过渡选项（来源：</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ttp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">//</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">minimi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ttp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">//</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）。直接后果是「中国直发小包</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免税」的低成本模型被打破，关税与尾程须重新计入</span></span></span></span></span>C_{\\text{shipping}}$，仓配代发的相对优势因此上升。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，平台的时效与身份规则。</strong> TikTok Shop 的商家物流政策要求订单在约定处理时限内发货并上传有效物流轨迹，禁止虚假发货与轨迹造假，虚假物流属严重违规（来源：TikTok Shop Seller Center <a href=\"https://seller-us.tiktok.com/）。eBay\">https://seller-us.tiktok.com/）。eBay</a> 明确要求商品标注的发货地必须与实际发货地一致，禁止「标称本国发货、实从他国直发」（来源：eBay 政策 <a href=\"https://www.ebay.com/help/selling/）。这让「一件代发从哪发货」从运营细节升级为合规红线。\">https://www.ebay.com/help/selling/）。这让「一件代发从哪发货」从运营细节升级为合规红线。</a></p>\n<p><strong>第三，税务与申报主体。</strong> 欧盟自 2021 年 7 月起对 ≤150 欧元的 B2C 进口征收 VAT，并要求通过 IOSS（Import One-Stop Shop）申报，改革方向是进一步取消 150 欧元关税免税门槛（来源：欧盟委员会 taxation and customs union <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/）。代发卖家即便无实体，也可能需在目的国完成税务登记。折成工程需求：履约层必须能按目的国计算落地成本、校验「申报货值\">https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/）。代发卖家即便无实体，也可能需在目的国完成税务登记。折成工程需求：履约层必须能按目的国计算落地成本、校验「申报货值</a> / 发货地 / 面单信息」三者一致、留存物流轨迹证据以备平台与海关核查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四种代发模式的差别不在「是否代发」，而在<strong>库存归属、面单身份可见性、尾程控制权</strong>三个维度；用同一套接口建模会掩盖真正的成本与风险差异。</li>\n<li>一件代发的默认行业约定是<strong>盲发</strong>——面单与包装不得暴露供应商，这是商业护城河，必须在供应商模板层强制。</li>\n<li>库存同步的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是超卖窗口，用安全系数缩水展示是通用做法；白标与仓配代发的库存决策升级为带 MOQ 的补货问题，可用再订货点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\bar{d}L + z\\sigma_{dL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9145em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 建模。</li>\n<li>2025 年 de minimis 豁免的暂停（含全球范围）重构了跨境小包的经济性，仓配代发（区域仓）的相对优势上升；时效与发货地真实性已成平台硬规则。</li>\n<li>模式选择须同时回答三个问题：货从哪来、面单怎么写、退货回哪去。任何一个说不清，履约链路都会在售后阶段暴露。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 后续章节分别深入这些分叉：库存与价目同步的工程实现见 <code>../2_inventory-price-sync/INDEX.md</code>，订单路由与盲发履约见 <code>../3_order-routing-blind-fulfillment/INDEX.md</code>，退货与跨境风险运营见 <code>../4_returns-risk-crossborder-ops/INDEX.md</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代发履约模式与商业模型分类（纯代发/一件代发/仓配代发/白标）","id":"代发履约模式与商业模型分类-纯代发-一件代发-仓配代发-白标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"一分钟建立经济模型直觉","id":"一分钟建立经济模型直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"纯代发与一件代发的工程差异","id":"纯代发与一件代发的工程差异"},{"level":2,"text":"仓配代发：用资金换时效确定性","id":"仓配代发-用资金换时效确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"白标与私有品牌：把代发链路品牌化","id":"白标与私有品牌-把代发链路品牌化"},{"level":3,"text":"盲发链路的三种模式对照","id":"盲发链路的三种模式对照"},{"level":2,"text":"模式选择的合规与政策约束","id":"模式选择的合规与政策约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"供应商准入与能力档案建模（SKU 覆盖、时效、区域、盲发资质）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/dropship-model-supplier-network/supplier-onboarding-capability-model"}}